{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "aiwritex-html-3b542ae5c377",
  "type": "html-template",
  "original": {
    "html": "<section\n  style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif SC', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; padding: 0;\">\n\n  <section\n    style=\"padding: 20px 20px 5px; margin-bottom: 15px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a2a6c, #b21f1f); border-radius: 0 0 25px 25px; color: white; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\">\n    <h1 style=\"font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 900; margin: 0; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1.2;\">投资新纪元</h1>\n    <h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 5px 0 15px; opacity: 0.9;\">人工智能如何重塑全球金融市场</h2>\n    <section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; margin-top: 15px;\">\n      <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"fill: white; margin-right: 8px;\">\n        <path\n          d=\"M11.99 2C6.47 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.47 10 9.99 10C17.52 22 22 17.52 22 12S17.52 2 11.99 2zM12 20c-4.42 0-8-3.58-8-8s3.58-8 8-8 8 3.58 8 8-3.58 8-8 8zm.5-13H11v6l5.25 3.15.75-1.23-4.5-2.67z\" />\n      </svg>\n      <span style=\"font-size: 0.9rem; opacity: 0.8;\">2025年6月特刊</span>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <section\n    style=\"padding: 15px; margin: 0; background-color: white; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n    <p\n      style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 600; color: #1a2a6c; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.4;\">\n      当人工智能遇上金融市场，一场前所未有的革命正在席卷全球投资领域。</p>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: justify;\">\n      过去两年，人工智能技术在投资决策中的应用已从实验阶段迅速转向主流。从量化对冲基金到个人投资者，AI驱动的分析正在改变我们理解市场、评估风险和寻找机会的方式。</p>\n\n    <section\n      style=\"background-color: #f2f7ff; padding: 15px; border-left: 4px solid #1a2a6c; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;\">\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; font-style: italic; color: #1a2a6c;\">\"我们正处于投资方法论的范式转变中。AI不仅仅是工具，它正在成为投资决策的核心驱动力。\" —\n        高盛集团首席数据科学家</p>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"margin: 15px 0; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\n    <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/600/300?random=1\" alt=\"AI金融科技\"\n      style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0;\">\n    <section style=\"padding: 20px; background-color: white; border-radius: 0 0 16px 16px;\">\n      <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.4rem; margin: 0 0 15px; color: #b21f1f; font-weight: 700; padding-left: 10px;\">AI驱动投资的五大趋势\n      </h3>\n      <ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 0 10px;\">\n        <li style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding-left: 0; position: relative; display: flex; align-items: flex-start;\">\n          <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"fill: #b21f1f; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 2px;\">\n            <path\n              d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-2 15l-5-5 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l7.59-7.59L19 8l-9 9z\" />\n          </svg>\n          <span style=\"font-weight: 600; margin-left: 8px;\">超个性化投资组合：AI根据个人风险偏好、财务目标和生活阶段定制投资策略</span>\n        </li>\n        <li style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding-left: 0; position: relative; display: flex; align-items: flex-start;\">\n          <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"fill: #b21f1f; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 2px;\">\n            <path\n              d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-2 15l-5-5 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l7.59-7.59L19 8l-9 9z\" />\n          </svg>\n          <span style=\"font-weight: 600; margin-left: 8px;\">实时市场情绪分析：从社交媒体、新闻和金融报告中提取市场情绪</span>\n        </li>\n        <li style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding-left: 0; position: relative; display: flex; align-items: flex-start;\">\n          <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"fill: #b21f1f; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 2px;\">\n            <path\n              d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-2 15l-5-5 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l7.59-7.59L19 8l-9 9z\" />\n          </svg>\n          <span style=\"font-weight: 600; margin-left: 8px;\">预测性经济指标：预测通胀、利率和经济增长等关键指标</span>\n        </li>\n        <li style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding-left: 0; position: relative; display: flex; align-items: flex-start;\">\n          <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"fill: #b21f1f; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 2px;\">\n            <path\n              d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-2 15l-5-5 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l7.59-7.59L19 8l-9 9z\" />\n          </svg>\n          <span style=\"font-weight: 600; margin-left: 8px;\">自动化交易执行：根据复杂算法自动执行交易，减少人为偏见</span>\n        </li>\n        <li style=\"margin-bottom: 0; padding-left: 0; position: relative; display: flex; align-items: flex-start;\">\n          <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"fill: #b21f1f; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 2px;\">\n            <path\n              d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-2 15l-5-5 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l7.59-7.59L19 8l-9 9z\" />\n          </svg>\n          <span style=\"font-weight: 600; margin-left: 8px;\">替代数据整合：分析卫星图像、信用卡消费和物联网数据等非传统数据源</span>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <section\n    style=\"margin: 0; padding: 15px; background-color: white; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n    <h3\n      style=\"font-size: 1.4rem; margin: 0 0 20px; color: #1a2a6c; font-weight: 700; border-bottom: 2px solid #f0f0f0; padding-bottom: 10px;\">\n      市场格局的变革</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: justify;\">\n      2024年第三季度，全球AI驱动的资产管理规模突破8.7万亿美元，较去年同期增长47%。这一惊人增长背后，是机构投资者对AI技术的空前信任。</p>\n    <section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 25px 0;\">\n      <svg width=\"300\" height=\"180\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 180\">\n        <!-- 坐标轴 -->\n        <line x1=\"40\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"140\" style=\"stroke:#5269CE;stroke-width:2\" />\n        <line x1=\"40\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"140\" style=\"stroke:#5269CE;stroke-width:2\" />\n\n        <!-- 柱状图，使用红色主调 -->\n        <rect x=\"70\" y=\"100\" width=\"30\" height=\"40\" style=\"fill:#5269CE;opacity:0.7;\" />\n        <rect x=\"120\" y=\"80\" width=\"30\" height=\"60\" style=\"fill:#5269CE;opacity:0.8;\" />\n        <rect x=\"170\" y=\"60\" width=\"30\" height=\"80\" style=\"fill:#5269CE;opacity:0.9;\" />\n        <rect x=\"220\" y=\"40\" width=\"30\" height=\"100\" style=\"fill:#5269CE;\" />\n\n        <!-- 标签 -->\n        <text x=\"85\" y=\"155\" style=\"font-size:10px;text-anchor:middle;fill:#5269CE;\">2022</text>\n        <text x=\"135\" y=\"155\" style=\"font-size:10px;text-anchor:middle;fill:#5269CE;\">2023</text>\n        <text x=\"185\" y=\"155\" style=\"font-size:10px;text-anchor:middle;fill:#5269CE;\">2024</text>\n        <text x=\"235\" y=\"155\" style=\"font-size:10px;text-anchor:middle;fill:#5269CE;\">2025</text>\n        <text x=\"155\" y=\"175\"\n          style=\"font-size:12px;text-anchor:middle;fill:#5269CE;font-weight:bold;\">AI驱动资产管理规模增长</text>\n\n        <!-- Y轴标签 -->\n        <text x=\"35\" y=\"140\" style=\"font-size:10px;text-anchor:end;fill:#5269CE;\">0</text>\n        <text x=\"35\" y=\"100\" style=\"font-size:10px;text-anchor:end;fill:#5269CE;\">2万亿</text>\n        <text x=\"35\" y=\"60\" style=\"font-size:10px;text-anchor:end;fill:#5269CE;\">4万亿</text>\n        <text x=\"35\" y=\"20\" style=\"font-size:10px;text-anchor:end;fill:#5269CE;\">6万亿</text>\n      </svg>\n    </section>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: justify;\">\n      传统金融机构正经历前所未有的转型压力。摩根大通、高盛等巨头已将AI集成到其核心投资流程中，而新兴的AI优先金融科技公司则凭借技术优势迅速崛起，重塑市场竞争格局。</p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; text-align: justify;\">\n      值得注意的是，监管机构对AI投资的态度正经历微妙变化。从最初的谨慎观望到积极制定监管框架，各国监管机构正努力在促进创新与保护投资者之间找到平衡点。</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section\n    style=\"margin: 0; padding: 15px; background-color: white; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n    <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.4rem; margin: 0 0 20px; color: #b21f1f; font-weight: 700;\">中国市场：AI投资的新前沿</h3>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: justify;\">中国市场正迅速成为AI投资的关键战场。随着监管政策的逐步完善和本土科技企业的崛起，中国特色的AI投资生态系统正在形成。</p>\n\n    <section\n      style=\"background-color: #fff8f8; padding: 15px; border-radius: 12px; margin: 20px 0; border: 1px solid #ffebeb;\">\n      <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #b21f1f;\">中国AI投资市场三大特点</h4>\n      <section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n        <section\n          style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #b21f1f; color: white; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-right: 15px; font-weight: bold;\">\n          1</section>\n        <section style=\"flex: 1;\">\n          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 600;\">移动支付生态系统提供海量数据</p>\n          <p style=\"margin: 5px 0 0; font-size: 0.9rem; opacity: 0.8;\">中国庞大的移动支付用户为AI算法提供了无与伦比的训练数据</p>\n        </section>\n      </section>\n      <section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n        <section\n          style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #b21f1f; color: white; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-right: 15px; font-weight: bold;\">\n          2</section>\n        <section style=\"flex: 1;\">\n          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 600;\">监管沙盒推动创新</p>\n          <p style=\"margin: 5px 0 0; font-size: 0.9rem; opacity: 0.8;\">金融监管部门设立的AI沙盒项目正加速金融科技创新</p>\n        </section>\n      </section>\n      <section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center;\">\n        <section\n          style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #b21f1f; color: white; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-right: 15px; font-weight: bold;\">\n          3</section>\n        <section style=\"flex: 1;\">\n          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 600;\">零售投资者的快速采纳</p>\n          <p style=\"margin: 5px 0 0; font-size: 0.9rem; opacity: 0.8;\">超过6000万中国个人投资者已使用AI驱动的投资工具</p>\n        </section>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; text-align: justify;\">\n      蚂蚁集团和腾讯金融等科技巨头已将AI深度整合到其投资产品中，而以智富科技和理想投资为代表的AI投资初创公司则通过专注细分市场迅速积累用户。预计到2026年，中国AI投资市场规模将突破2万亿元人民币。</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section\n    style=\"margin: 15px 0; padding: 15px; background-color: white; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n    <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.4rem; margin: 0 0 20px; color: #1a2a6c; font-weight: 700;\">个人投资者的机遇与挑战</h3>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: justify;\">\n      对于个人投资者而言，AI工具的普及既是机遇也是挑战。一方面，高级分析工具的民主化让普通投资者能够获取曾经只有机构才能使用的分析能力；另一方面，如何在信息爆炸的时代保持判断力成为新的挑战。</p>\n\n    <section style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 0 0;\">\n      <section style=\"margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 15px; background-color: #f0f4ff; border-radius: 12px;\">\n        <svg width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"fill: #1a2a6c; margin: 0 auto 10px; display: block;\">\n          <path\n            d=\"M19 3H5c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v14c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V5c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm-7 15.5h-1.5V14h-1v-1.5H11v-1h1.5V10h1v1.5H15V13h-1.5v5.5zM5.5 9.5h3v-1h-2v-1h2v-1h-3V9.5zM9 11H6v1.5h2v1H6V15h3v-4zm6.5 2.5h-2v1h2V13.5z\" />\n        </svg>\n        <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 5px; font-size: 1rem; text-align: center;\">基础分析</h4>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 0.9rem; text-align: center; opacity: 0.8;\">自动化基本面分析和技术指标</p>\n      </section>\n      <section style=\"margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 15px; background-color: #f0f4ff; border-radius: 12px;\">\n        <svg width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"fill: #1a2a6c; margin: 0 auto 10px; display: block;\">\n          <path\n            d=\"M19 3H5c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v14c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V5c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zM9 17H7v-7h2v7zm4 0h-2V7h2v10zm4 0h-2v-4h2v4z\" />\n        </svg>\n        <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 5px; font-size: 1rem; text-align: center;\">风险管理</h4>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 0.9rem; text-align: center; opacity: 0.8;\">实时投资组合风险预警</p>\n      </section>\n      <section style=\"margin-bottom: 0; padding: 15px; background-color: #f0f4ff; border-radius: 12px;\">\n        <svg width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"fill: #1a2a6c; margin: 0 auto 10px; display: block;\">\n          <path d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm1 15h-2v-6h2v6zm0-8h-2V7h2v2z\" />\n        </svg>\n        <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 5px; font-size: 1rem; text-align: center;\">智能提醒</h4>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 0.9rem; text-align: center; opacity: 0.8;\">个性化市场机会提醒</p>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; color: #b21f1f; margin: 25px 0 15px;\">如何明智地利用AI投资工具？</p>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: justify;\">\n      投资专家建议，个人投资者应将AI视为强大的辅助工具，而非全权决策者。关键是要理解AI模型的基本逻辑，认识到技术的局限性，并始终保持独立思考能力。</p>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; text-align: justify;\">\n      特别值得注意的是，投资者应警惕市场上鱼龙混杂的AI投资产品。选择具有透明算法、明确风险提示和良好历史业绩的平台至关重要。理想的做法是将多种AI工具结合使用，并与传统投资方法相互验证。</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section\n    style=\"margin: 15px 0 25px; padding: 15px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a2a6c, #b21f1f); border-radius: 16px; color: white; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\">\n    <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.4rem; margin: 0 0 15px; font-weight: 700;\">展望未来</h3>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; opacity: 0.9;\">AI投资领域的下一波创新已呼之欲出。从多模态学习到因果推理，新一代AI技术有望进一步提升预测准确性和决策质量。</p>\n\n    <section style=\"background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding: 15px; border-radius: 12px; margin: 20px 0;\">\n      <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 1.1rem;\">三大未来趋势</h4>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 600; opacity: 1;\">📊 去中心化金融与AI的融合</span> -\n        智能合约与AI决策系统的结合将创造全新投资模式</p>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 600; opacity: 1;\">🧠 情感智能的应用</span> - AI将能更准确理解和预测投资者心理与市场情绪\n      </p>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 600; opacity: 1;\">🔍 解释性AI的崛起</span> - 可解释的AI模型将提高投资决策的透明度与可信度</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 500;\">\n      在这个新时代，成功的投资者将是那些既能利用AI优势，又保持人类独特判断力的人。技术只是工具，智慧仍是投资成功的关键。</p>\n  </section>\n\n</section>"
  },
  "html": "<section style=\"box-sizing: border-box\" id=\"cw-layout-imported\"><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #333; font-family: 'Noto Serif SC', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0\"><section style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgb(26, 42, 108), rgb(178, 31, 31)); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08); border-radius: 0px 0px 25px 25px; box-sizing: border-box; color: white; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 20px 20px 5px; margin-top: 0px;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; margin-top: 0px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; text-indent: 0px;\">开场第一段：比赛结束后，人们先看到了比分。阅读一篇文章，也需要先交代背景，让读者知道事情从哪里开始。</p></section><section style=\"background-color: white; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border-radius: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 15px\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: justify\">开场第二段：比分接近，真正需要讨论的是关键时刻的判断。连续的正文应留在同一个阅读容器里，左右都应有清楚的留白。</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: justify\">开场第三段：接下来再进入具体章节。段落数量改变时，不应丢失内容，不应贴边，也不应为每段重复一层巨大的卡片内边距。</p></section><section><p style=\"border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0; box-sizing: border-box; display: block; font-size: 16px; height: auto; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 15px; max-width: 100%; text-align: justify; width: 100%\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1499951360447-b19be8fe80f5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\" alt=\"桌面上的阅读与写作\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 16px 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"></p></section><section style=\"background-color: white; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border-radius: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 15px\"><h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #1a2a6c; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-top: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; text-indent: 0\">从标题开始，建立阅读节奏</h2><section><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: justify\">标题需要一个清楚的重心。<strong>重点句只强调一次</strong>，其余正文让段落长度、行距和留白承担节奏。</p></section><section><blockquote style=\"border: 0; border-left: 0; margin: 0; padding: 0\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #1a2a6c; font-size: 16px; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0; margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: justify\">排版的任务，是把内容的关系呈现出来。</p></blockquote></section><section><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: justify\">每种风格都应该有自己的声音，同时让正文保持完整、清楚和可读。</p></section></section><section style=\"background-color: white; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border-radius: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 15px\"><h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #1a2a6c; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-top: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; text-indent: 0\">三个可以马上检查的地方</h2><section><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #333; list-style-type: none; margin: 0 0 0 10px; padding: 0\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; margin-bottom: 12px; padding-left: 0\">标题是否有独立的视觉重心</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; margin-bottom: 12px; padding-left: 0\">章节之间是否留出呼吸空间</li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; margin-bottom: 12px; padding-left: 0\">重点是否与普通正文形成清楚层级</li></ul></section><section><p style=\"border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0; box-sizing: border-box; display: block; font-size: 16px; height: auto; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 15px; max-width: 100%; text-align: justify; width: 100%\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1455390582262-044cdead277a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\" alt=\"写作中的页面\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 16px 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"></p></section><section><p style=\"border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0; box-sizing: border-box; display: block; font-size: 16px; height: auto; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 15px; max-width: 100%; text-align: justify; width: 100%\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1515378791036-0648a3ef77b2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\" alt=\"工作台上的笔记\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 16px 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"></p></section><section><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; color: #333; margin: 18px 0; table-layout: fixed; width: 100%\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">检查项</th><th style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">观察方式</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">标题</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">第一眼能否找到主题</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">正文</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">是否能够连续阅读</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">引用</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">是否与作者叙述区分</td></tr></tbody></table></section><section><p style=\"border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0; box-sizing: border-box; display: block; font-size: 16px; height: auto; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 15px; max-width: 100%; text-align: justify; width: 100%\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544947950-fa07a98d237f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\" alt=\"打开的杂志与页面\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 16px 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"></p></section></section><section style=\"background-color: white; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border-radius: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 15px\"><h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #1a2a6c; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-top: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; text-indent: 0\">把风格落实到每一个细节</h2><section><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: justify\">报纸用硬边栏线建立秩序，杂志用大留白放慢速度，信笺让段落像一次自然的交谈。</p></section><section><p style=\"border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0; box-sizing: border-box; display: block; font-size: 16px; height: auto; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 15px; max-width: 100%; text-align: justify; width: 100%\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1481627834876-b7833e8f5570?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\" alt=\"阅读中的书页\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 16px 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"></p></section><section><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: justify\">一个完整的句子，不应该为了装饰被删掉。一张原有的表格，也不应该被换成没有事实来源的数字。</p></section><section><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: justify\">读完之后，留下一个清楚的观点，比留下许多重复的色块更有价值。</p></section></section></section></section>",
